cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use Nubi or its campus data, please cite it as below, and also cite
  the original data sources (see README.md, "Data sources and licences").
title: "Nubi: a walkable 3D map of Yonsei University's Sinchon campus"
abstract: >-
  Nubi (누비, from 누비다, "to roam all over freely" in Korean): a 2.5-3D web
  map of Yonsei University's Sinchon campus, built from public data
  (OpenStreetMap, GIS building outlines, the building register, a terrain
  model) and modelled building by building. It offers third- and
  first-person views, walking routes in three profiles (quickest, step-free,
  least climbing), an underground view, facilities with their opening hours,
  shade at any time, and a map assistant. All its data is kept as one
  versioned SQLite release with an IMDF-based schema.
type: software
authors:
